OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FQuite windy. Many dry
OL,6,Fthrough to mid-afternoon with some
OL,7,Fearly brightness in east. Patchy rain
OL,8,Fin far west building and extending to
OL,9,Frest of area late afternoon to early
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FEarly
OL,13,Frain Thursday across the east and
OL,14,Fsouth, clearing erratically as
OL,15,Fbrighter spells and showers feed from
OL,16,Fwest. Scattered showers for Friday,
OL,17,Ffocused in west. Saturday mainly dry,
OL,18,Foccasionally bright.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
